{"title":"High-Quality Games and Fun","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3101657_highquality_games_and_fun\">High-Quality Games and Fun</a> is an AoPS game forum founded by <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Megahertz13\">megahertz13</a> on August 12, 2022. It has reached up to 2nd on the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c9_other_forums\">Other Forums</a>. It is also administrated by <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Sotowa\">Sotowa</a> and moderated by <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Bob_Smart\">Bob_Smart</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:mynameisJEJ\">mynameisJEJ</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:EthanSpoon\">EthanSpoon</a>, and <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:k1glaucus\">k1glaucus</a>. Other notable contributers include former moderators <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Cothoop\">cothoop</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:delicatehunter\">delicatehunter</a>, and <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Desertsnow\">Desertsnow</a>, active users <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:BlueGecko\">BlueGecko</a> and <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Speedcuber7\">SpeedCuber7</a>, and game makers <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:PatTheKing806\">PatTheKing806</a> and <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:ryanbear\">ryanbear</a>. More data can be found in <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3101657h2928835_data_center\">the Data Center</a>.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<caption>Names\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Forum Name</th>\n<th>Time Periods</th>\n<th>More info\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Math Puzzles &amp; Games</td>\n<td>Aug 12, 2022 - Sept 1, 2022</td>\n<td>This is the original name and the namesake of MPG\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Math, Puzzles, and Games</td>\n<td>Sept 1, 2022 - Sept 9, 2022</td>\n<td>Suggestion by MrMustache to fix the grammar (and noted by zlrara01)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>The Incredible Forum</td>\n<td>Sept 9, 2022 - Nov 20, 2022; Nov 28, 2022 - present</td>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3101657h2967647_forum_name_voting\">Voted back</a> after it was changed for branding\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>High-Quality Games and Fun</td>\n<td>Nov 20, 2022 - Nov 28, 2022</td>\n<td>Not to be confused with <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c898035_high_quality_fun_amp_games\">High-Quality Fun &amp; Games</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017193840\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.013 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐exp